<custom_item>
  type            : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description     : "1.0278 - MSSRV - Ensure Network Security: Allow PKU2U authentication requests to this computer to use online identities is set to Disabled"
  info            : "This setting determines if online identities are able to authenticate to this computer."
  solution        : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Disabled : Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Local Policies\Security Options\Network Security: Allow PKU2U authentication requests to this computer to use online identities"
