<custom_item>
  type            : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description     : "1.0310 - MSSRV - Configure Interactive logon: Message text for users attempting to log on"
  info            : "This policy setting specifies a text message that is display to users when they log on."
  solution        : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, configure the following UI path to a value that is consistent with the security and operational requirements of your organization: Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Local Policies\Security Options\Interactive logon: Message text for users attempting to log on"
