<custom_item>
  type            : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description     : "1.0312 - MSSRV - Ensure Interactive logon: Prompt user to change password before expiration is set to between 5 and 14 days"
  info            : "This policy setting determines how far in advance users are warned that their password will expire."
  solution        : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to a value between 5 and 14 days : Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Local Policies\Security Options\Interactive logon: Prompt user to change password before expiration"
