<custom_item>
  type            : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description     : "1.0314 - MSSRV - Ensure Interactive logon: Smart card removal behavior is set to Lock Workstation or higher"
  info            : "This policy setting determines what happens when the smart card for a logged-on user is removed from the smart card reader."
  solution        : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Lock Workstation, Force Logoff or Disconnect if a Remote Desktop Services session : Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Local Policies\Security Options\Interactive logon: Smart card removal behavior"
